==Battleground==
*10 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*6 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**6 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main threat is the Fallen Bear, who has up to an additional 750,000 HP with his Shield. Bring a [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercer]] such as [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]], and send in [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] when his shield is down in order to cripple his HP or even kill him right away.

==Trivia==
*Bad Instinct's Origin, [[Summit Shrine (Merciless)/Aku|Bad Instinct's Apex]] and [[Frontier Shrine (Merciless)/Aku|Bad Instinct's Refuge]] are the only [[Talent Orbs|Talent Orb]] [[Enigma Stages]] not to follow the "X Cradle, X Summit, X Frontier" naming scheme for their maps.
*The "Instinct" in Bad Instinct's Origin, Bad Instinct's Apex and Bad Instinct's Refuge refers to Instinct Orbs, a literal translation of Talent Orbs' Japanese name (本能玉 ''Hon'nō-dama'').

